        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"59275062-48ee-431d-80f0-0cb021e8f689\",\"review_text\":\"U guys are s*it\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0feed5d-7e21-4c19-8696-5bc3fe1c1cf4\",\"review_text\":\"F***\"},{\"review_id\":\"e155847c-f6ad-4385-a524-a6e9a4631325\",\"review_text\":\"At first Ioved this app! Until yesterday I set alarms with Spotify and it started to play random songs I have never played before. It does that when I click on a song too,I hope you can fix this problem.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d6a976f-f58a-4d1c-9986-554260696cff\",\"review_text\":\"This is wonderful 😘 kamal ka h ye app\"},{\"review_id\":\"3d2aec43-dc2b-44d3-a4cd-3b70e0a47aa0\",\"review_text\":\"Outstanding ❤️\"},{\"review_id\":\"eab26d38-d3a7-471e-917f-d0ce82cc3e7a\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever exist\"},{\"review_id\":\"b45f27f0-d01f-4c13-b3d6-c15478110a5c\",\"review_text\":\"Sign in problem everytime when I enter phone number it's says check your number\"},{\"review_id\":\"1b751c32-86d5-4aa7-b01d-5f0481f72ca5\",\"review_text\":\"App is not even opening. I have tried everything restarting my phone, clearing app data & cache , checking internet connection, reinstalling the app , software update in my phone still the app is not opening. It just shows green icon.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4d5d3d9a-0157-4401-a71f-b5cce5b0873b\",\"review_text\":\"Great selection of tracks thanks. Good work!\"},{\"review_id\":\"51d26ecd-d061-4ad6-ae0d-f2bf6d0ccf23\",\"review_text\":\"I just love it... 😆😆😆\"}]}"
